    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Amazing and epic adventures await you! </strong></h2>This is a huge world precipitated and designed by Sin.Alfred.Huang over 20 years!<br>From the great epic of the Cambrian to the Cretaceous, you can follow along with the rumored Black Beetle mercenaries to learn all about it.<br>Such as the perpetual winter, when the tide came and they had to live on the bottom of the sea. Burning all the nine hot sun, the earth a barren era.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076550/extras/6874401bda4051aabe0c8ac41434de45.avif?t=1702195173\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076550/extras/1383c5069b764f0367772e75d9062df2.avif?t=1702195173\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging 2D ARPG!</strong></h2>Step by step through the difficulty of play, constantly challenge more powerful monsters, make more beautiful and powerful equipment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076550/extras/90349860c98f0ef7076a516a7f256a9d.avif?t=1702195173\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rich and diverse weapon systems! </strong></h2>There are more than two dozen weapons with different gameplay, and each weapon type feels like a fresh start.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076550/extras/79f24b9d589f5cd977a5649dfef8ccef.avif?t=1702195173\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Constantly updated play content!</strong></h2>Constantly updating the game to add content to the game, even if it stops updating years later, is amazing!",
